<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Privacy policy — PanFrikandel</title>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<header class="nav">
  <a href="/" class="logo">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="logo-mark"><rect width="100" height="100" rx="22" fill="#FF4D00"/><rect x="20" y="40" width="60" height="22" rx="11" fill="#A0522D" stroke="#2A1503" stroke-width="6"/></svg>
    <span translate="no">PanFrikandel</span>
  </a>
  <%- include('partials/lang') %>
</header>
<div class="page">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:700">This is a courtesy translation. In case of doubt, the <a href="/prywatnosc?lang=pl">Polish version</a> prevails.</p>

  <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
  <p>The controller of your personal data is <strong><%= company.name %></strong> (trading as PanFrikandel)<% if (company.address) { %>, <%= company.address %><% } %><% if (company.nip) { %>, tax ID (NIP): <%= company.nip %><% } %>, contact: <%= company.email %>.</p>

  <h2>2. What data we process and why</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Order data</strong> (name, delivery address, e-mail, phone number) — to perform the sales and delivery contract, including arranging the delivery time (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</li>
    <li><strong>Payment data</strong> — processed by Stripe Payments Europe Ltd.; we do not store card details.</li>
    <li><strong>Postcode</strong> entered when checking the delivery zone — stored without any other data, solely for statistics (assessing the reach of our delivery service and planning its expansion).</li>
    <li><strong>Requests</strong> (wholesale quotes, food truck event bookings: name, e-mail, phone, company, message) — to prepare an offer and get back to you (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR).</li>
    <li><strong>Food truck location alerts</strong> (e-mail, optionally your town, language) — based on your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR), confirmed via a link in an e-mail. We only send information about where and when the food truck is, plus your personal discount code. You can withdraw consent at any time via the "Unsubscribe" link in every message.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The GPS position shown on the food truck page is the location of our vehicle, not of users.</p>

  <h2>3. Retention period</h2>
  <p>We keep order data for the period required by tax and accounting regulations.</p>

  <h2>4. Recipients</h2>
  <p>Stripe (payments), Resend (order confirmation e-mails) and our hosting provider. We deliver ourselves — no data is passed to courier companies.</p>

  <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to access, rectify and erase your data, to restrict processing, to data portability, and to lodge a complaint with the Polish supervisory authority (President of the Personal Data Protection Office, UODO).</p>

  <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
  <p>The site uses only strictly necessary technical mechanisms (your cart and checked postcode stored locally in the browser, and a cookie remembering your language). We do not use marketing or tracking cookies.</p>

  <p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">← Back to the shop</a></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
